@When "^perform Partial Termination event on the '([^']*)' trade$"
    When opens lifecycle action 'partial termination' for current trade
    And component dynamic action types new notional from stored variable 'partialTermination.newNotional'
    And component dynamic action types amount from stored variable 'partialTermination.unwindFeeAmount'
    And submits lifecycle event and waits for page ready

@Then "^the trade notional reflects the partial termination reduction in trade detail page$"
    Then double click to navigate to trade detail and wait for page ready for stored variable 'createdTradeId'
    And page trade detail basic info notional amount field shows value from stored variable 'expectedNotional'
    And page trade detail status badge shows 'LIVE'

@Then "^the partial termination is completed successfully$"
    Then assert toast notification with type 'success' and message '${json-unit.regex}Trade .* updated with new notional .*'
